---
// Debajo de una tabla de listado: «26–50 de 143 clientes» y las páginas (con huecos: 1 … 4 5 6 … 12).
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { hrefWith } from '../lib/table.js';

const { info, url, noun = ['fila', 'filas'] } = Astro.props;
const go = (p) => hrefWith(url, { pagina: p });
---
<nav class="pager" aria-label="Páginas">
  <span class="pager-count">
    {info.total ? <>{info.from}–{info.to} de <b>{info.total}</b> {info.total === 1 ? noun[0] : noun[1]}</> : <>0 {noun[1]}</>}
  </span>
  {info.last > 1 && (
    <span class="pager-pages">
      {info.prev ? <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href={go(info.prev)} rel="prev"><Icon name="chevron-left" size={16} /> Anterior</a> : <span class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm is-disabled" aria-disabled="true"><Icon name="chevron-left" size={16} /> Anterior</span>}
      {info.items.map((p) => (p === '…'
        ? <span class="pager-gap">…</span>
        : p === info.page ? <span class="pager-page is-current" aria-current="page">{p}</span> : <a class="pager-page" href={go(p)}>{p}</a>))}
      {info.next ? <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href={go(info.next)} rel="next">Siguiente <Icon name="chevron-right" size={16} /></a> : <span class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm is-disabled" aria-disabled="true">Siguiente <Icon name="chevron-right" size={16} /></span>}
    </span>
  )}
</nav>
